# Architecture diagrams are the portfolio headline

- Lead README and project docs with rendered diagrams from `docs/architecture/rendered/`.
- Keep editable sources in `docs/architecture/sources/` (Mermaid + draw.io).
- Re-render with `docs/architecture/scripts/render-all.sh` after source edits.
- Prefer C4, deployment, sequence, failure/recovery, and threat-boundary diagrams over decorative graphics.
- Keep the navy / teal / amber / crimson visual language consistent.
- Never let diagrams drift from implementation.
